        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (-3)^3 \\div 6]</span>.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: (-3)^3 \\div 6].",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS. First, we compute the exponents:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (\u2212 3)^{3}_(\u23df)_(\u2212 27) \u00f7 6 = (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6]</span></p><p>Then, we divide:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6|=; ((\u2212 27))/(6)|=; \u2212 (27)/(6)|=; \u2212 (27 \u00f7 3)/(6 \u00f7 3)|=; \u2212 (9)/(2)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS. First, we compute the exponents:\n\n[MATH: (\u2212 3)^{3}_(\u23df)_(\u2212 27) \u00f7 6 = (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6]\n\nThen, we divide:\n\n[MATH: (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6|=; ((\u2212 27))/(6)|=; \u2212 (27)/(6)|=; \u2212 (27 \u00f7 3)/(6 \u00f7 3)|=; \u2212 (9)/(2)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: (-3)^3 \\div 6].\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS. First, we compute the exponents:\n\n[MATH: (\u2212 3)^{3}_(\u23df)_(\u2212 27) \u00f7 6 = (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6]\n\nThen, we divide:\n\n[MATH: (\u2212 27) \u00f7 6|=; ((\u2212 27))/(6)|=; \u2212 (27)/(6)|=; \u2212 (27 \u00f7 3)/(6 \u00f7 3)|=; \u2212 (9)/(2)]"
      },
